# Product Feature Rules

**Entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) · **Standards:** [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) §3.3, §3.5 · **Deep dive:** [docs/ai/07-feature-product.md](../../docs/ai/07-feature-product.md)

## Structure

`data/models/` → `data/repos/product_repo_impl.dart` → `presentation/manager/*_cubit/`

## Public API (ground truth: `product_repo_impl.dart`)

`/api/v1/public/products`, `.../search`, `.../autocomplete`, `.../categories`, `.../categories/{slug}/products`, `.../products/{slug}`

No `Authorization` header on these calls.

## Must

- Add endpoints on `ProductRepo` + impl; return `Either<Failure, T>`
- Wire JSON via `EngineRequestMapper` + `VariantScreen` → `dataContext.requests.{requestKey}`
- Match JSON `requestUrl` to repo path patterns
- Register new cubits as factories in `service_locator.dart`

## Must not

- Fetch products inside engine renderers
- Hardcode grids/lists in Dart when JSON `gridView` + `itemBuilder` suffices
- Parse raw API JSON in presentation widgets

## Cubits

`ProductCubit`, `ProductDetailCubit`, `ProductSearchCubit`, `ProductAutocompleteCubit`, `CategoryCubit`

Mapper routing: [docs/ai/04-actions-and-requests.md](../../docs/ai/04-actions-and-requests.md)
